{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merhen Fantasy Action Adventure 'Odile: Black Duckling Tale' is a game that becomes a little duck and grows up by taking away human power and collects multi-endings. Its main features include pretty dot graphics, fairytale-like stories, and interaction with NPCs with fun movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/sc00.png?t=1749208325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full-fledged game begins when a black duck being bullied in the woods follows one of a princess, a shaman, or a hunter into town. Who would you join?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c0_\uc601\uc5b4.png?t=1749208325\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c1_\uc601\uc5b4.png?t=1749208325\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c2_\uc601\uc5b4.png?t=1749208325\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c3_\uc601\uc5b4.png?t=1749208325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate the black duck to take human energy. Taking up a lot of energy can kill humans, and sometimes witnesses. If you let them run scared, the black duck could be in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/sc05.png?t=1749208325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normally no one notices the little duck's covert behavior, but sometimes there are attack NPCs that see through the duck's black magic, resulting in a battle. Run up, down, jump, and roll to avoid the attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/sc07.png?t=1749208325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While 'Odile' is a story-heavy game, most of the text is delivered through the NPC's speech bubble without stopping gameplay. SCG dialogue events only come at a level where the story does not interfere with gameplay and helps you immerse yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform belt-scrolling action on three stages: the palace, the temple, and the tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And experience 28 multi-endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Early Access version only allows you to play the 'Palace Route' and includes only 13 endings. We plan to add more routes and allow you to collect more endings through future updates.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Meeting with the princess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320840/cfaf2196291e835df82ba2271923e02404675110.jpg"},{"name":"Meeting the Maiden of the Sun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320840/05395a1227e656694462d924dd869fa58821e1ff.jpg"},{"name":"Meeting with the Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320840/b9b2103b3dd1475391ce08ab9124d29d0c687e23.jpg"},{"name":"It's hot!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320840/4dd7471085dd456d5f6ba31ffb8d971c1ecb6376.jpg"},{"name":"I'm subjugated.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320840/d897ac2cffb0e48bb9f3f27247716d5741bb05ee.jpg"},{"name":"I got caught.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320840/672b4973f438ea3c1f47eb698291a3050da9509b.jpg"},{"name":"Ouch...!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320840/acfc0e867a759d8395072669c9f7a7c6338e1c57.jpg"},{"name":"The ducks bothered me.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320840/2711ce7a739cc399948112cf6c507779f08ac2a7.jpg"},{"name":"I want to run away.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320840/dc1b6112020510678d53c8cc1f7cbdac198d2f2d.jpg"},{"name":"Bwaaah!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3320840/aba19784a313d41dd3694d930a798c8509ec0f05.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3320840?t=1749208325","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749208325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/7e33a0a9d1ac8dbcae8f73120bb900465a76e87b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749208325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/7e33a0a9d1ac8dbcae8f73120bb900465a76e87b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749208325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merhen Fantasy Action Adventure 'Odile: Black Duckling Tale' is a game that becomes a little duck and grows up by taking away human power and collects multi-endings. Its main features include pretty dot graphics, fairytale-like stories, and interaction with NPCs with fun movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/sc00.png?t=1749208325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full-fledged game begins when a black duck being bullied in the woods follows one of a princess, a shaman, or a hunter into town. Who would you join?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c0_\uc601\uc5b4.png?t=1749208325\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c1_\uc601\uc5b4.png?t=1749208325\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c2_\uc601\uc5b4.png?t=1749208325\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc18c\uac1c3_\uc601\uc5b4.png?t=1749208325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate the black duck to take human energy. Taking up a lot of energy can kill humans, and sometimes witnesses. If you let them run scared, the black duck could be in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/sc05.png?t=1749208325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normally no one notices the little duck's covert behavior, but sometimes there are attack NPCs that see through the duck's black magic, resulting in a battle. Run up, down, jump, and roll to avoid the attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/sc07.png?t=1749208325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While 'Odile' is a story-heavy game, most of the text is delivered through the NPC's speech bubble without stopping gameplay. SCG dialogue events only come at a level where the story does not interfere with gameplay and helps you immerse yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform belt-scrolling action on three stages: the palace, the temple, and the tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And experience 28 multi-endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Early Access version only allows you to play the 'Palace Route' and includes only 13 endings. We plan to add more routes and allow you to collect more endings through future updates.</p>","developers":["Sunflo Labs","Solutena Studio"],"dlc":[3753350],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/header.jpg?t=1749208325","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257069129,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257069129/movie480.mp4?t=1749061405","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257069129/movie_max.mp4?t=1749061405"},"name":"\uc5bc\ub9ac\uc5d1\uc138\uc2a4 \ud2b8\ub808\uc77c\ub7ec","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257069129/a7bfcddfa44e6928e194f3e5d486a8477da53183/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749061405","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257069129/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749061405","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257069129/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749061405"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257069130,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257069130/movie480.mp4?t=1730922314","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257069130/movie_max.mp4?t=1730922314"},"name":"\ubcf4\uceec\uace1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257069130/132fbcea6feb6ab476dfa2f42564bdbe1c948a6a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1730922314","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257069130/movie480_vp9.webm